🎮 NEON STRIKE - HOW TO GET YOUR CODE
=========================================

All your code is already in the workspace! Here's how to get it:

METHOD 1: Copy Files from Workspace (EASIEST)
---------------------------------------------
1. Look at the "Files" panel on the left side
2. Click on each file to see its content
3. Copy the content
4. Create the same file on your computer
5. Paste the content

METHOD 2: Download Individual Files
---------------------------------
1. In the Files panel, right-click any file
2. Select "Download" (if available)
3. Save to your computer

METHOD 3: Use Git (BEST FOR DEPLOYMENT)
---------------------------------------
1. Open terminal/command prompt on your computer
2. Navigate to where you want the project:
   cd /path/to/your/projects
3. Copy the entire src/ and server/ folders from workspace
4. Or use the files panel to copy each file

WHAT YOU NEED TO COPY:
--------------------
✅ src/ folder (all subfolders and files)
✅ server/ folder (all files)
✅ package.json
✅ package-lock.json
✅ tsconfig.json, tsconfig.app.json, tsconfig.node.json
✅ vite.config.ts
✅ index.html
✅ .gitignore
✅ .env.example
✅ README.md
✅ DEPLOYMENT_GUIDE.md
✅ MULTIPLAYER_GUIDE.md

DON'T COPY:
-----------
❌ node_modules/ (will install with npm install)
❌ dist/ (will build with npm run build)
❌ .vercel/ (auto-generated)

AFTER COPYING:
-------------
1. Open terminal in your project folder
2. Run: npm install
3. Run: npm run dev
4. Open http://localhost:5173

READY TO DEPLOY:
----------------
1. Create GitHub repo
2. Push code (see MULTIPLAYER_GUIDE.md)
3. Deploy server to Render
4. Deploy frontend to Vercel

That's it! 🎉
